msgstr "Löschen"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Drop your first SVG here"
msgstr "Leg dein erstes SVG hier ab"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Drop SVG files here"
msgstr "SVG-Dateien hier ablegen"

#: build/panel.js
msgid ""
"Every file is sanitised and hardened on the way in. Same bar as a media "
