msgstr "Neuer Name für %s"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Speichern"

#. translators: %s: icon name.
#: build/panel.js
msgid "Copy the call for %s"
msgstr "Aufruf für %s kopieren"

#. translators: %s: icon name.
#: build/panel.js
msgid "Rename %s"
msgstr "%s umbenennen"

#. translators: %s: icon name.
#: build/panel.js
msgid "Delete %s"
msgstr "%s löschen"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Name"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Optional. The slug is derived from it."
msgstr "Optional. Daraus wird der Slug abgeleitet."

#: build/panel.js
msgid "e.g. arrow-right"
msgstr "z. B. pfeil-rechts"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "SVG markup"
msgstr "SVG-Markup"

#: build/panel.js
msgid ""
"Paste the <svg>…</svg>. It is sanitised and hardened before it is stored, "
"exactly like a dropped file."
msgstr ""
"Füge das <svg>…</svg> ein. Es wird bereinigt und gehärtet, bevor es "
"gespeichert wird, genau wie eine abgelegte Datei."

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Vorschau"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Adding…"
msgstr "Fügt hinzu…"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Hinzufügen"

#. translators: 1: the saved cap in MB, 2: the highest allowed cap in MB.
#: build/panel.js
msgid ""
"The size cap was saved as %1$d MB, the nearest allowed value (1 to %2$d)."
msgstr ""
"Das Größen-Limit wurde als %1$d MB gespeichert, dem nächsten erlaubten Wert "
"(1 bis %2$d)."

#: build/panel.js
msgid "What runs"
msgstr "Was läuft"

#: build/panel.js
msgid ""
"Both are off by default. The security layer is always on: every SVG is "
"sanitised and the size cap applies. There is no switch for it."
msgstr ""
"Beide sind standardmäßig aus. Die Sicherheitsschicht ist immer aktiv: jede "
"SVG wird bereinigt, und das Größen-Limit greift. Dafür gibt es keinen "
"Schalter."

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Allow SVG uploads in the media library"
msgstr "SVG-Uploads in der Mediathek erlauben"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Editors can upload .svg files; each one is sanitised on the way in."
msgstr ""
"Redakteure können .svg-Dateien hochladen; jede wird beim Upload bereinigt."

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Enable the icon library"
msgstr "Icon-Bibliothek aktivieren"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Adds the Icon library tab and the Icon block."
msgstr "Fügt den Tab „Icon-Bibliothek“ und den Icon-Block hinzu."

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sicherheit"

#: build/panel.js
msgid ""
"The cap limits what the sanitiser will parse. It applies whatever the "
"features above are set to."
msgstr ""
"Das Limit begrenzt, was der Sanitizer parst. Es greift unabhängig davon, wie "
"die Funktionen oben stehen."

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Maximum SVG size (MB)"
msgstr "Maximale SVG-Größe (MB)"

#. translators: %d: the highest allowed cap in MB.
#: build/panel.js
msgid ""
"Files larger than this are rejected before the sanitiser runs. Allowed: 1 to "
"%d MB."
msgstr ""
"Größere Dateien werden abgewiesen, bevor der Sanitizer läuft. Erlaubt: 1 bis "
"%d MB."

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Increase the size cap"
msgstr "Größen-Limit erhöhen"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Decrease the size cap"
msgstr "Größen-Limit verringern"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "%d MB"
msgstr "%d MB"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "Ungespeicherte Änderungen"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "All changes saved"
msgstr "Alle Änderungen gespeichert"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "Speichert…"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Zurücksetzen"

#: build/panel.js
msgid "Easy SVG Pro"
msgstr "Easy SVG Pro"

#: build/panel.js
msgid ""
"The agency layer for SVG icons. It lives in this panel, once Pro is active "
"and licensed."
msgstr ""
"Die Agentur-Schicht für SVG-Icons. Sie liegt in diesem Panel, sobald Pro "
"aktiv und lizenziert ist."

